<title>FRANCE: Framatome net profit rises in 1996.</title>
<headline>Framatome net profit rises in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     894  vs	    663</p>
<p>    Turnover		    (billions)    15.2  vs	   17.9</p>
<p>Note - State-controlled nuclear engineering group Framatome said its 1996 net profit represented 5.9 percent of its turnover. It noted 1995 had been affected by &quot;negative elements&quot; related to the sale of Framatome's stake in Compagnie de Navigation Mixte. Alcatel Alsthom holds a 44 percent stake in Framatome.</p>
<p>Framatome said that its order book totalled 32.8 billion francs at end December 1996 compared with 27.4 billion at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>About one half of its turnover was derived from abroad.</p>
</text>
